      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.09 (vs ₹3.19 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.09 (down from ₹3.19 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹565.9m (down 19% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹16.3m (down 34% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 2.9% (down from 3.6% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 7% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 31% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
