      "title": "Dhanalaxmi Roto Spinners Limited Appoints Ms. Samskruthi Malpani As Whole-Time Company Secretary Cum Compliance Officer Effective January 2, 2026",
      "body": "Dhanalaxmi Roto Spinners Limited appointed Ms. Samskruthi Malpani as the Whole-Time Company Secretary cum Compliance Officer of the company effective January 2, 2026. The Board of Directors decided to appoint Ms. Samskruthi Malpani as the Whole-Time Company Secretary cum Compliance Officer during the meeting held on January 2, 2026. Ms. Samskruthi Malpani is an Associate Member of the Institute of Company Secretaries of India with membership No: A78656. She possesses the requisite qualifications and skills and is well-versed in applicable laws, rules, and regulatory compliances. Ms. Samskruthi Malpani submitted her consent to act as the Whole-Time Company Secretary cum Compliance Officer of Dhanalaxmi Roto Spinners Limited. Ms. Samskruthi Malpani is not related to any Director or Key Manag",
